# opentv-adblock: Google ad servers
# Appended to the TV's /etc/hosts at boot. These domains only serve ads and ad tracking.
#
# Deliberately NOT blocked, because apps need them to play video at all:
#   imasdk.googleapis.com   Google IMA video player SDK (SonyLIV and others)
#   dai.google.com          Google Dynamic Ad Insertion: some live streams are served
#                           entirely through it, so blocking it stops the stream
#
# Add your own entries to hosts.custom in the install folder, not here.

0.0.0.0 doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 www.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 ad.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 ad-g.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 ad.mo.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 cm.g.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 fls.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 googleads.g.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 googleads4.g.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 m.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 mediavisor.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 pagead.l.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 pagead46.l.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 pubads.g.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 securepubads.g.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 static.doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 stats.g.doubleclick.net

0.0.0.0 googlesyndication.com
0.0.0.0 ade.googlesyndication.com
0.0.0.0 afs.googlesyndication.com
0.0.0.0 pagead2.googlesyndication.com
0.0.0.0 tpc.googlesyndication.com
0.0.0.0 video-ad-stats.googlesyndication.com

0.0.0.0 googleadservices.com
0.0.0.0 www.googleadservices.com
0.0.0.0 partner.googleadservices.com

0.0.0.0 googletagservices.com
0.0.0.0 www.googletagservices.com

0.0.0.0 adservice.google.com
0.0.0.0 adservice.google.co.in
0.0.0.0 adservice.google.co.uk
0.0.0.0 adservice.google.de

0.0.0.0 2mdn.net
0.0.0.0 s0.2mdn.net
0.0.0.0 s1.2mdn.net
